Only stat effects are applied; otherwise no effect on Incubus:
* {{i|Analog Stick|a+nr}}
* {{i|Eye Drops}}
* {{i|Marked|anr}}
* {{i|Maw Of The Void|nr}}
* {{i|Technology 2|nr}}
