== Trivia ==
* In folklore, [[wikipedia:incubus|incubi]] are evil spirits said to descend upon sleeping people, specifically ones fabled to have sexual intercourse with women during their sleep, or, more simply put, the male version of a [[wikipedia:Succubus|succubus]].
* If playing with a controller, you will notice the shooting deadzone for the incubus is smaller than Isaac's.

